  - m_Id: 83242471383089
    m_Localized: 'Device: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383090
    m_Localized: Your account is linked and your progress is saved with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383091
    m_Localized: We need the internet for this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383092
    m_Localized: Linking didn't work. Please try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383093
    m_Localized: Linking with Apple works on iPhone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383094
    m_Localized: Delete account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383095
    m_Localized: Your account and progress will be deleted from this phone now, and
      from our servers within 30 days. They can't be recovered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383096
    m_Localized: Delete my account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383097
    m_Localized: Your account was deleted. Starting fresh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383098
    m_Localized: We need the internet for this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383099
    m_Localized: Deleting didn't work. Please try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383100
    m_Localized: Help and contact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383101
    m_Localized: Is my progress saved?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383102
    m_Localized: Always on your phone, and in the cloud when you're online. Link
      your account to Apple or Google so it's never lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383103
    m_Localized: How do I move to a new phone?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383104
    m_Localized: Link your account in Settings, then link the same account in Settings
      on the new phone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383105
    m_Localized: I bought something and didn't get it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383106
    m_Localized: Write to us below and we'll answer within 48 hours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383107
    m_Localized: How do I delete my account?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383108
    m_Localized: In Settings, choose Delete my account. We delete all your data within
      30 days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383109
    m_Localized: Write to us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383110
    m_Localized: Write your message here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383111
    m_Localized: Your email (optional)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383112
    m_Localized: We send your account number, game version and phone model with your
      message, so we can help faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383113
    m_Localized: Send
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383114
    m_Localized: Write your message first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383115
    m_Localized: We got your message. We'll answer within 48 hours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383116
    m_Localized: We need the internet for this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83242471383117
