      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109159629447187
    m_Localized: Out of energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109159629447188
    m_Localized: It fills up by itself. Meanwhile, sell small pieces you don't need,
      or merge what's on the board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109159629447189
    m_Localized: "+{0} energy \xB7 {1} gems"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109159629447190
    m_Localized: An extra copy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109159629447191
    m_Localized: Your last merge floated a copy in a bubble. It disappears after
      a minute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109159629447192
    m_Localized: Take it for {0} gems
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
